      "normalizedSource": "A concrete subclass must therefore provide an initialization or creation method and override the [`forwardInvocation(_:)`](nsproxy/forwardinvocation(_:).md) and [`methodSignatureForSelector:`](nsproxy/methodsignatureforselector:.md) methods to handle messages that it doesn’t implement itself.",
